806: *  device falsified that in its own code: the ALT-CTRL arm assigned
807: *  cur_command = COMMAND_RESET WITHOUT CALLING THIS HELPER, so the most
808: *  reset-like operation the device had was not a caller at all.  The SCOPE
809: *  paragraph forty lines below said so; a universal headline with its qualifier
810: *  that far down is read as universal.  Named by the fable seat on #479 pass 2.
811: *
812: *  wdc_command() cleared the ATAPI flag and the error and nothing else, so three
